        "raw": "[name=\"Candela\"]With the sand she collected, she's synthesizing glass pillars at wherever she lands to give herself her next leap.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Candela",
        "content": "With the sand she collected, she's synthesizing glass pillars at wherever she lands to give herself her next leap."
    },
    {
        "id": 110,
